WEBVTT

00:00.060 --> 00:04.020
Episode 12: ZENSHU

00:31.090 --> 00:32.750
The Soul Future...

00:33.380 --> 00:36.140
I can't... believe it.

00:38.750 --> 00:40.270
It's over.

00:45.310 --> 00:47.730
This is the last piece.

01:23.810 --> 01:28.010
"Flashing five times 
is a sign to kill you dead."

01:46.320 --> 01:48.400
Ow.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.780
Are we back?

01:50.580 --> 01:51.460
Memmeln?

01:51.460 --> 01:53.090
Memmeln!

01:53.090 --> 01:56.130
I knew you'd figure it out!

01:59.580 --> 02:00.550
Look.

02:04.550 --> 02:07.090
The Soul Future's <i>gone</i>?!

02:10.320 --> 02:12.390
Huh? Luke?

02:14.720 --> 02:18.190
Luke! Luke!

02:19.890 --> 02:21.900
What the heck's going on?

02:21.900 --> 02:24.190
Luke destroyed the Soul Future.

02:24.190 --> 02:25.240
Luke did?

02:25.240 --> 02:27.620
But there's no way he'd <i>ever</i> do that!

02:29.160 --> 02:30.250
What's going on?

02:30.630 --> 02:31.650
Crap.

02:31.650 --> 02:33.390
Unio! Cast a defense spell!

02:33.390 --> 02:33.960
Huh?

02:33.960 --> 02:35.120
Hurry!

02:41.120 --> 02:43.960
I don't need anything.

02:50.130 --> 02:52.150
I don't desire anything.

02:58.450 --> 02:59.660
Nothing.

03:52.560 --> 03:54.290
The Ultimate Void.

03:54.620 --> 03:55.700
Natsuko!

03:57.530 --> 04:00.010
Ride on my back.

04:10.020 --> 04:11.670
Unio! Go higher!

04:29.240 --> 04:31.410
It's the Ultimate Void!

04:35.620 --> 04:37.910
Seriously, what the heck is going on?

04:37.910 --> 04:40.200
Luke has turned into the Ultimate Void.

04:40.200 --> 04:42.620
What?! But that makes no sense!

04:42.620 --> 04:49.050
I mean, Luke's the legendary hero who's fought
 to protect the Soul Future this whole time.

04:49.050 --> 04:50.560
Why would Luke...

04:52.020 --> 04:55.220
Memmeln, you don't follow Voidism 
now, right? You're okay, yeah?

04:55.570 --> 04:59.990
Natsuko, I am a Sir Exister
 stan for all eternity.

05:01.720 --> 05:02.710
Right!

05:08.780 --> 05:10.660
Don't touch that!

05:10.660 --> 05:13.170
Get out of the town! Run!

05:13.440 --> 05:15.210
I'm done for.

05:15.210 --> 05:17.540
You can't give up! Come on!

05:17.540 --> 05:20.300
Come, my wives. Hurry!

05:20.300 --> 05:21.530
Run!

05:31.690 --> 05:39.480
I suppose I will stay and witness the end
 along with the Nine Soldiers.

05:44.740 --> 05:47.990
No matter what you do, it's no use.

05:48.850 --> 05:49.940
Luke!

05:49.940 --> 05:51.190
Luke!

05:51.190 --> 05:54.530
Luke, look! It's Natsuko!

05:54.530 --> 05:55.330
Huh?

05:55.330 --> 05:57.810
It's Natsuko, who you love so much!

05:57.810 --> 05:59.030
Hey, uh, stop that.

06:04.310 --> 06:05.720
Luke! Stop!

06:21.940 --> 06:24.820
This is awful.

06:28.070 --> 06:31.210
Is that really Luke?

06:31.530 --> 06:35.020
It seems he can no longer hear us.

06:35.790 --> 06:37.650
What should we do?

06:38.080 --> 06:40.240
How are we supposed to fight him?

06:42.190 --> 06:46.090
What happens after this in 
the "moo-vee" you saw, Natsuko?

06:46.090 --> 06:47.680
There's nothing after this.

06:48.050 --> 06:50.810
This is where <i>A Tale of Perishing</i> ends.

06:50.810 --> 06:55.420
The Ultimate Void destroys the world
 and everyone dies here.

06:55.420 --> 06:56.770
No way.

06:59.010 --> 07:01.720
That's why I've never seen 
beyond this point.

07:01.720 --> 07:05.130
Because the story of us getting
 Luke back is just beginning.

07:05.770 --> 07:07.020
Natsuko-san.

07:07.690 --> 07:11.500
Get him back? Will we be able to save him?

07:17.720 --> 07:18.920
I'm...

07:20.530 --> 07:21.830
gonna fix all this.

07:22.160 --> 07:23.640
Fix all...?

07:24.040 --> 07:27.230
The movie <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>
 means the world to me,

07:27.230 --> 07:30.130
but I can't just watch it all end like this.

07:30.900 --> 07:34.880
I <i>won't</i> let Luke's story end here.

07:35.510 --> 07:36.660
I'm...

07:37.880 --> 07:39.260
gonna fix all this.

07:39.260 --> 07:41.670
We will fight at your side.

07:41.670 --> 07:45.470
We're counting on you, Natsuko.
 Save Luke for us.

07:45.470 --> 07:46.300
Right.

07:49.480 --> 07:50.710
<i>What should I draw?</i>

07:52.890 --> 07:54.110
<i>What should I draw?</i>

07:58.110 --> 07:59.370
<i>What should I draw?</i>

07:59.370 --> 08:01.380
<b>Konkon</b>

08:01.600 --> 08:03.250
<i>The most powerful thing...</i>

08:03.250 --> 08:04.510
<i>But I have no time.</i>

08:04.510 --> 08:07.080
<i>Something super powerful
 I can draw perfectly...</i>

08:20.650 --> 08:21.600
Draw.

08:22.140 --> 08:24.390
You need to draw, me!

09:15.200 --> 09:16.450
Natsuko!

09:19.250 --> 09:21.020
It's done!

09:21.920 --> 09:22.000
<b>Fix all</b>

09:22.000 --> 09:22.290
<b>Fix all</b>

09:30.200 --> 09:33.460
The legendary hero and 
one of the Nine Soldiers:

09:33.910 --> 09:36.220
Luke Braveheart!

09:42.980 --> 09:44.020
Look!

09:46.550 --> 09:47.800
Luke?

09:47.800 --> 09:49.050
Luke?

09:49.370 --> 09:51.010
It's the Great Hero.

09:53.880 --> 09:56.320
Megi Amideki...

09:56.820 --> 09:58.110
Magiya!

10:06.690 --> 10:08.660
Put a stupidly big spell on his sword...

10:13.050 --> 10:15.540
Tear him asunder!

10:30.940 --> 10:32.060
This can work.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.740
It's the Great Hero again.

10:46.500 --> 10:47.250
<b>Konkon</b>

10:46.500 --> 10:47.250
<b>Konkon</b>

11:07.800 --> 11:10.030
Natsuko! Are you okay?

11:34.710 --> 11:36.690
He disappeared again.

11:36.690 --> 11:38.810
He's only getting started.

11:38.810 --> 11:42.930
I mean, he's the legendary hero,
 Luke Braveheart.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.290
Don't you worry.

11:48.160 --> 11:49.780
Don't give up yet.

11:50.680 --> 11:52.940
Natsuko's still fighting.

11:55.830 --> 11:57.090
It's coming again!

12:06.000 --> 12:07.070
Juschan!

12:07.900 --> 12:10.990
It's not over yet!

12:28.980 --> 12:31.060
Justice disappeared.

12:32.950 --> 12:37.390
Juschan will be back at 
Serval Cat House tomorrow.

12:37.390 --> 12:38.460
Really?

12:38.460 --> 12:44.110
Yup. So tomorrow, let's make sure
 we all do lots of fun things.

12:44.110 --> 12:46.130
Fun things?

12:46.130 --> 12:47.580
Whatever you want.

12:47.900 --> 12:51.860
You can do whatever you want tomorrow.

12:51.860 --> 12:54.760
So be sure to think about 
what you want to do.

12:54.760 --> 12:56.380
I wanna make a cake.

12:56.380 --> 12:57.540
I wanna draw.

12:57.540 --> 13:00.060
But will tomorrow come?

13:00.060 --> 13:04.300
It will. Nacchan's protecting us, after all.

13:04.300 --> 13:07.120
And Nacchan's super strong.

13:07.120 --> 13:09.820
So close your eyes for now.

13:09.820 --> 13:10.800
Okay.

13:11.360 --> 13:14.210
It'll be tomorrow after a little nap.

13:15.310 --> 13:18.670
It's okay. Don't worry.

13:37.820 --> 13:38.740
Unio!

13:40.370 --> 13:41.450
Memmeln?

13:43.510 --> 13:45.340
I'm leaving the rest to you!

13:58.550 --> 14:00.630
Memmeln!

14:14.210 --> 14:19.870
We promised once the world was at peace and 
you didn't have to be the great hero anymore,

14:19.870 --> 14:22.370
you and I would go off somewhere, remember?

14:22.370 --> 14:24.000
Just plain ol' you and me.

14:27.500 --> 14:30.260
We were gonna see a bunch of things
 we'd never seen before.

14:30.800 --> 14:33.400
You said that day would come for sure.

14:33.400 --> 14:35.880
You were looking forward to it!

14:37.390 --> 14:39.630
Megi Amideki Magiya.

14:39.970 --> 14:42.310
Megi Amideki Magiya.

14:42.700 --> 14:44.830
Megi Amideki Magiya.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.290
Megi—

14:47.480 --> 14:48.970
Luke...

14:50.270 --> 14:53.320
Damn it all!

15:06.820 --> 15:11.380
This is fine. I can draw Luke 
even with my eyes closed.

15:31.210 --> 15:32.610
Natsuko!

15:32.610 --> 15:34.360
Are you done yet?

15:35.850 --> 15:37.160
QJ?

15:37.680 --> 15:38.790
But how?

15:38.790 --> 15:41.490
Meg and Sally put me back together.

15:41.490 --> 15:46.250
More importantly, I asked you to 
make sure we got a happy ending, didn't I?

15:46.610 --> 15:47.790
Yeah...

15:48.510 --> 15:49.270
Yeah!

16:04.740 --> 16:07.190
Natsuko! Your body...

16:08.860 --> 16:12.610
Natsuko! Don't die!

16:17.140 --> 16:18.740
Natsuko!

16:20.170 --> 16:22.360
Give me the drawings!

16:25.290 --> 16:27.000
Hurry!

16:27.350 --> 16:30.250
Give me the drawings!

16:31.130 --> 16:34.140
And I'm <i>done</i>!

16:34.140 --> 16:39.590
Fix all!

16:57.900 --> 16:59.910
<i>We need you.</i>

17:04.400 --> 17:06.150
<i>I want to see you.</i>

17:09.640 --> 17:11.440
<i>Even if you're in despair right now,</i>

17:11.990 --> 17:16.700
<i>I promise you there'll 
be a day filled with fun.</i>

17:18.440 --> 17:19.810
<i>So please...</i>

17:19.810 --> 17:20.760
<i>Live.</i>

17:23.020 --> 17:25.050
Luke!

17:25.640 --> 17:29.640
I love you!

17:25.640 --> 17:29.640
I love you!

17:55.240 --> 17:56.450
This is...

17:57.570 --> 17:58.850
My body is...

18:02.350 --> 18:03.450
Luke!

18:15.420 --> 18:16.510
Luke.

18:22.690 --> 18:24.290
Natsuko?

18:25.190 --> 18:26.220
Luke!

19:01.490 --> 19:03.470
Unbelievable.

19:04.000 --> 19:08.580
A brand new Soul Future 
has been bestowed upon this world.

19:09.380 --> 19:13.120
All of the wounds inflicted 
by the Voids are healing.

19:13.120 --> 19:14.120
Thank goodness.

19:18.380 --> 19:19.720
Juschan!

19:19.720 --> 19:22.670
Hey! Whoa, whoa, whoa.

19:24.710 --> 19:27.470
Thank you so much, Nacchan.

19:28.050 --> 19:30.240
Soul Future responses detected.

19:31.930 --> 19:34.290
They're overflowing 
from all around the world.

19:41.820 --> 19:44.230
It truly is a miracle.

19:46.400 --> 19:48.950
Hmph. Easygoing simpletons.

19:49.410 --> 19:52.630
Don't go thinking happy endings 
are all there is to entertainment.

19:54.160 --> 19:56.460
Memmeln!

20:01.260 --> 20:03.030
Are you hurt?

20:03.030 --> 20:07.230
I'm fine. Meg, Sally, everyone...

20:07.820 --> 20:09.790
I'm so happy you're alive.

20:22.320 --> 20:23.910
Luke...

20:25.770 --> 20:27.410
Thank goodness.

20:27.940 --> 20:28.950
Natsuko?

20:32.930 --> 20:34.840
I have to go now, Luke.

20:35.630 --> 20:40.410
There's a lot I still have 
to do back in reality.

20:40.410 --> 20:41.720
Natsuko.

20:42.190 --> 20:44.650
Goodbye, Luke.

20:45.230 --> 20:46.300
Natsuko!

20:46.850 --> 20:48.630
I'll love you forever.

20:53.400 --> 20:57.140
Next time, I'll go to 
the Kingdom of Reality.

20:57.920 --> 20:59.610
I promise I'll come see you.

20:59.610 --> 21:00.880
So wait for me!

21:03.870 --> 21:06.140
Natsuko!

21:11.090 --> 21:14.450
<i>That was my first love.</i>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Even if the sun forgives you,
 my lightning will not!</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Sukeban Magical Girl
Dark Academy</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Sukeban Magical Girl
Dark Academy</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Sukeban Magical Girl
Dark Academy</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Today Is Yesterday,
Tomorrow Is Now,
And Every Day Is Summer.</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>Director / Natsuko Hirose</b>

21:18.380 --> 21:20.880
<b>HATSUKOI:
First Love</b>

21:21.360 --> 21:22.500
Director.

21:24.390 --> 21:27.380
The corrections came in. 
Could you look them over?

21:31.840 --> 21:33.380
Yup, looks good.

21:35.040 --> 21:37.500
I'm super thankful. All a-okay.

21:37.500 --> 21:38.810
Thank you so much.

21:38.810 --> 21:41.660
The movie's a huge hit, honey bun!

21:41.960 --> 21:44.700
It's all thanks to you, Natsuko. Thank you.

21:44.700 --> 21:47.650
It wasn't all me. 
Everyone here played their part.

21:48.110 --> 21:51.790
I'm already thinking about my next project.
Will you work with me again?

21:51.790 --> 21:52.580
Huh?

21:52.990 --> 21:54.160
Sure!

22:05.580 --> 22:06.800
Good job, you guys.

22:08.270 --> 22:09.360
Isn't that crazy?

22:09.360 --> 22:11.180
That was huge.

22:20.960 --> 22:21.710
Huh?

22:22.690 --> 22:24.940
<b>The End</b>
